  "description": "Protect your cargo with a heavy-duty FRP hard tri-fold tonneau cover. Built for durability, easy no-drill installation, and everyday weather protection, its folding design provides convenient bed access.\nFeatures\nHeavy-Duty FRP Construction: Built with reinforced fiberglass (FRP) panels, this hard tri-fold tonneau cover delivers durable strength and reliable load-bearing performance for everyday truck bed use.\nQuick No-Drill Installation: Designed for a hassle-free setup, the FRP truck bed cover installs with included hardware and clear instructions—no drilling required. Note: Cargo racks must be removed before installation.\nAll-Weather Cargo Protection: The hard panels help shield your truck bed cargo from rain, snow, road debris, impacts, and sharp objects, providing dependable protection for everyday hauling and travel.\nTri-Fold Design for Easy Access: The folding truck bed cover opens and folds conveniently when you need access to your cargo, while allowing you to quickly cover the bed when cargo protection is needed.\nConvenient Nighttime Visibility: A complimentary LED light helps illuminate the truck bed after dark, making it easier to see and access your cargo in low-light conditions.\n1-Year Warranty | Professional installation is highly recommended for safety.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2015-2026 Chevrolet Colorado Crew Cab with 5 Feet Bed\nCompatible with 2015-2026 GMC Canyon Crew Cab with 5 Feet Bed",
  "highlights": [
    "Quick No-Drill Installation: Install with ease using the included hardware and clear instructions—no drilling required. Get the cover mounted quickly and ready for everyday use.",
    "Reinforced Strength & Load Capacity: High-strength FRP panels provide a solid, durable construction with impressive load-bearing capability, helping the cover withstand everyday demands.",
    "Reliable Everyday Cargo Protection: The hard FRP panels help shield your cargo from rain, snow, road debris, impacts, and sharp objects for dependable protection on daily drives."
  ],
